{"strongs": "H3038", "word": "יְדוּתוּן", "translit": "ye.du.tun", "root": "ידד", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "after the manner of", "definition": "יְדוּתוּן , יְדֻתוּן proper name, masculine usually יְדוּתוּן ; יְדֻתוּן 2Chr 5:12 ; 2Chr 35:15 יְדיּ֯תוּן Ps 39:1 ; Ps 77:1 ; Neh 11:37 ; 1Chr 16:38 chief of one of the three choirs of the temple (only Chronicles & Psalm-titles) 1Chr 9:16 ; 1Chr 16:38 ; 1Chr 16:41 ; 1Chr 16:42 ; 1Chr 25:3 (twice in verse); 1Chr 25:6 ; 2Chr 5:12 the king's seer 2Chr 35:15 his descendants formed one of the perpetual temple choirs בְּנֵי יְדוּתוּן 1Chr 16:42 ; 1Chr 25:1 ; 1Chr 25:3 ; 2Chr 29:14 בֶּןיְֿדיּ֯תוּן Neh 11:17 . In Psalm-titles על ידותון Ps 62:1 ; Ps 77:1 ( Qr ); לִידיּתוּן Ps 39:1 ( לְ error for עלֿ ), all = after the manner of (the choir of) Yeduthun (musical term according to RS OTJC 422, 2nd ed. 143 ). — see also Lag Or ii. 16 ff. and proper name אָסָף , הֵימָן (sub אמן ), אֵיתָן (sub יתן ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3451')\">BDB3451</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3038')\">H3038</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3450')\">BDB3450</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3452')\">BDB3452</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְדוּתוּן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יְדֻתוּן</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> usually <bdbheb>יְדוּתוּן</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>יְדֻתוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,12)\">2Chr 5:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,15)\">2Chr 35:15</ref> <bdbheb>יְדיּ֯תוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 39:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,1)\">Ps 39:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 77:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"77\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"77\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,77,1)\">Ps 77:1</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Neh 11:37\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBe